# Oxygen Mod (sign-replacer-addon) – workflow

**After every change** to this addon (any Java, resources, or config under `sign-replacer-addon/`):

1. Run **`./gradlew build`** from `sign-replacer-addon/`.  
   This compiles the mod and **automatically copies the JAR into the Prism Launcher mods folder** (deployToMods runs after every build). Always do this—do not skip.

2. Optionally run **`./gradlew build pushRepo`** if you also want to commit and push to git.

**Remember:** Every time you build this mod, run `./gradlew build` so the JAR is copied into the jar/mods folder. It’s part of the build.
